      - kind:
          Text: 1 Document Structure
  - kind:
      Marker:
        depth: 3
        kind: Heading
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: 1.1 Text Encoding
  - kind: Paragraph
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: "A document is a UTF-8 encoded file with a "
        children:
          - kind:
              Delimiter: Verbatim
            children:
              - kind:
                  Raw: ".mg"
          - kind:
              Text: " file extension. Leading byte-order marks (U+FEFF) are skipped by the parser. Line endings can be LF (U+000A) or CRLF (U+000D U+000A); parsing normalizes to LF."
  - kind:
      Marker:
        depth: 3
        kind: Heading
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: 1.2 Whitespace and Blank Lines
  - kind: Paragraph
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: "The following Unicode characters are whitespace:"
  - kind:
      Marker:
        depth: 1
        kind: UnorderedList
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: Tab (U+0009)
  - kind:
      Marker:
        depth: 1
        kind: UnorderedList
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: Space (U+0020)
  - kind: Paragraph
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: A line is blank when it is empty or contains only whitespace.
  - kind:
      Marker:
        depth: 3
        kind: Heading
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: 1.3 Paragraphs
  - kind: Paragraph
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: "A paragraph is a continuous sequence of text lines. Paragraphs are terminated by a blank line, structural marker ("
        children:
          - kind:
              Link: 2 Structural Markers
            attributes:
              - value: "#"
            children:
              - kind:
                  Delimiter: LinkName
                children:
                  - kind:
                      Text: "2"
          - kind:
              Text: "), or the end of the document. Line breaks within a paragraph are soft wraps: when parsed, each line is joined by a single space."
  - kind:
      Marker:
        depth: 2
        kind: Heading
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: 2 Structural Markers
  - kind: Paragraph
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: Structural markers open a line and give the following content a type.
