      Marker:
        depth: 2
        kind: Heading
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: 3 Semantic Delimiters
  - kind: Paragraph
    children:
      - kind:
          Text: "Semantic delimiters mark or group text to give it meaning, style, or structure. All delimiters open and close with two characters. Delimiters of different kinds can nest, but a delimiter cannot nest within itself."
